{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/groovy' data-target='computer\/programming\/groovy' data-title='Groovy'>\r\n\t\t\tGroovy\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Notes: List, Initialize, Append, Size, Index, and get.","label":"Notes","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/programming\/groovy\/notes.svg' alt='Working notes on Notes: List, Initialize, Append, Size, Index, and get.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><span>Ujnotes<\/span> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Working notes on Notes: List, Initialize, Append, Size, Index, and get.<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLoosely typed.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSuperset of Java.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCompiles to bytecode.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNo semicolon.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tString \u2018\u2019.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEval String \u201c\u201d.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Expression in eval string $()<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>variable \/ function : def<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>List<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDeclare.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t[].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Initialize<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Initialize [&lt;&gt;, &lt;&gt; ...]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Append<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;&lt; &lt;&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Size<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t.size().\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Index<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Index [&lt;index&gt;]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>get<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>get .findAll{&lt;expression&gt;}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Operate<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Operate *.&lt;function&gt;()<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t.collect{operation(it)}.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Map<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Declare<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t[:].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Initialize<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Initialize [&lt;&lt;Key&gt;:&lt;Value&gt;&gt;[,...]]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Key.<\/strong> String by default.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAppend.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPut.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAccess.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGet.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Loop<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Loop &lt;Number&gt;.times { &lt; &gt; }<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Loop &lt;list\/map&gt;.each {&lt;&gt;}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Loop (&lt;&gt;..&lt;&gt;).each {}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Loop &lt;Map&gt;.each { key, value -&gt;        println \"${key} = ${value}\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Print<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Print .println &lt;string&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Print .render &lt;string&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/groovy\/notes\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/groovy\/notes\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/programming\/groovy' data-target='computer\/programming\/groovy' data-title='Groovy'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/programming\/groovy.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Groovy<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}